        "When you end a scene with 5 or more of an Ailment, you may gain either 1 [b][color=ccbbaa]Safeguard[/color][/b] or 1 [b][color=ffcc50]Resolve[/color][/b] at the start of the next scene. At Level 9, increase the Safeguard to 2.",
